        "description": "Módulo/pasta `templates/` com arquivos-chave do projeto.",
        "file": "templates/",
        "code": "// ===== employee_detail.html =====\n{% load static %}\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"ie=edge\">\n    <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" integrity=\"sha384-9ndCyUaIbzAi2FUVXJi0CjmCapSmO7SnpJef0486qhLnuZ2cdeRhO02iuK6FUUVM\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\" integrity=\"sha384-geWF76RCwLtnZ8qwWowPQNguL3RmwHVBC9FhGdlKrxdiJJigb/j/68SIy3Te4Bkz\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"{% static 'css/style.css' %}\">\n    <title>Django Basics</title>    \n  </head>\n  <body>\t\n    <div class=\"container pt-5\">\n        <div class=\"card mx-auto\" style=\"width: 18rem;\">\n            <img class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"{{ employee.photo.url }}\" alt=\"Employee Photo\">\n            <div class=\"card-body\">\n              <p class=\"card-text m-0\">{{ employee.first_name }} {{ employee.last_name }}</p>\n              <p class=\"card-text m-0\">{{ employee.email_address }}</p>\n              <p class=\"card-text m-0\">{{ employee.designation }}</p>\n              <p class=\"card-text m-0\">{{ employee.phone_number }}</p>\n            </div>\n            <a href=\"{% url 'home' %}\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Back to Home</a>\n        </div>              \n    </div>   \n  </body>\n</html>\n\n// ===== home.html =====\n{% load static %}\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"ie=edge\">\n    <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" integrity=\"sha384-9ndCyUaIbzAi2FUVXJi0CjmCapSmO7SnpJef0486qhLnuZ2cdeRhO02iuK6FUUVM\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\" integrity=\"sha384-geWF76RCwLtnZ8qwWowPQNguL3RmwHVBC9FhGdlKrxdiJJigb/j/68SIy3Te4Bkz\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"{% static 'css/style.css' %}\">\n    <title>Django Basics</title>    \n  </head>\n  <body>\t\n    <div class=\"container pt-5\">\n        <h1>Employee List</h1>\n        <table class=\"table\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th scope=\"col\">#</th>\n                <th scope=\"col\">Full Name</th>\n                <th scope=\"col\">Designation</th>\n                <th scope=\"col\">Phone Number</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              {% for emp in employees %}             \n              <tr>\n                <!--<th>{{ emp.id }}</th>-->\n                <td>{{ forloop.counter }}</td>\n                <td><a href=\"{% url 'employee_detail' emp.id %}\">{{ emp.first_name }} {{ emp.last_name }}</a></td>\n                <td>{{ emp.designation }}</td>\n                <td>{{ emp.phone_number }}</td>\n              </tr>  \n              {% endfor %}           \n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n          <!--<img src=\"{% static 'images/django.png' %}\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\">-->\n    </div>   \n  </body>\n</html>",
